  'food.eyebrow':'Nutrition',
  'food.lede':'The coaching starts from the Nordic dietary pattern, one of the best-studied in Europe, and I tune it for a body that trains hard. You eat a lot, you eat well, and you are never hungry.',
  'food.c1.t':'Protein on every plate','food.c1.d':'Between 1.6 and 2.2 g per kilo of body weight daily, spread across 3–5 meals. Fatty fish, eggs, fermented dairy, lean meat and legumes.',
